web/frontend/dist/
web/frontend/.vite/
web/frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
# P1 浏览器 E2E 产物（Playwright）：失败截图 / trace / HTML 报告，只在本机留档
web/frontend/test-results/
web/frontend/playwright-report/
web/frontend/.playwright/
